@startuml UC17_SelectStarter_UseCase
title UC17 - Select Starter Pokemon (Use Case Diagram)
skinparam linetype ortho
left to right direction

actor Player

rectangle "Starter Pokemon System" {
  (New player after registration)
  (StoryScreen shows starter selection)
  (Display 3 starter options)
  (Player selects starter)
  (StoryService.GiveStarter)
  (PokemonSpawner creates starter)
  (Add to Player.PokemonTeam)
  (Receive initial items)
  (Story mode begins)
}

Player --> (New player after registration)
(New player after registration) --> (StoryScreen shows starter selection)
(StoryScreen shows starter selection) --> (Display 3 starter options)

note right of (Display 3 starter options)
  From story.json config:
  - Grass type
  - Fire type
  - Water type
end note

(Display 3 starter options) --> (Player selects starter)
Player --> (Player selects starter)
(Player selects starter) --> (StoryService.GiveStarter)
(StoryService.GiveStarter) --> (PokemonSpawner creates starter) : <<include>>
(PokemonSpawner creates starter) --> (Add to Player.PokemonTeam)
(Add to Player.PokemonTeam) --> (Receive initial items)
(Receive initial items) --> (Story mode begins)
(Story mode begins) --> Player

@enduml
